  "reviewed_invariants": [
    "assess_data_use retains the same operator API and data-use-assessment/1 envelope, with a separately versioned protected profile and private_plan_data_prerequisite_only authority for explicit private-target compilations.",
    "Positive private qualification is bound to the exact compiled identity, original formalization, public target, explicit private binding, protected snapshot and feature certificate. Full definitions/parameters/specification versions, normalization delay, source integrity and pinned reviewed rights bytes remain required.",
    "Candidate knowledge starts at original formalization ancestry before compiler-added private dependencies. A protected target already present in prior ancestry is never subtracted. Known protected/operations knowledge and unresolved concrete exposure references produce a private gap.",
    "Unknown model training alone is not converted to known exposure or a gap. Origin remains null with a reason, vintage remains unverified, delay remains an assumed scenario, independent_confirmation and reserved_role_verified remain false, and campaign selection/prior use remains NOT_ASSESSED.",
    "Private preparation requires a current exact matching private qualification. Its development diagnostics must be owned descriptive executions on the development snapshot explicitly named by the public declaration certificate, with valid case-blob hash/size, acceptable concrete ancestry and current dependencies.",
    "The unchanged numerical draft_plan calculation consumes the original candidate and policy inputs. It does not compute protected outcomes or validate empirical dependence-model adequacy.",
    "Private assessment, input capsule and plan retain assessment class and private binding ancestry. Research-role contexts and development wrappers remain denied. The new exception applies only to host consumption of private data-use/composition evidence and never permits final calibration ancestry.",
    "Private current inspection keeps scientific_data_and_exposure_acceptance open and reports protected_selection_and_reservation_review NOT_ASSESSED. Scientific readiness, protected admission, allocation reservation and freeze remain false.",
    "Completed request keys return historical bytes before new admission. Interrupted requests retain exact input/source capsules; retries cannot silently replace prerequisites. Commitment rechecks qualification, diagnostic bytes, other evidence and revocation after child work.",
    "Existing direct development behavior and numerical policy semantics are preserved. No generic-source or worker API can issue owned data qualification or private policy plans."
  ],
